517	/**
518	 * Server-safe repricing for newly generated invoice payloads. The assigned
519	 * quote replaces only the unit price; the Billing Product identity and tax
520	 * metadata remain attached to the line. Manual lines and non-automatic lines
521	 * are never changed.
